{"id":"7791cf2679dc1a37","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Stochastic Kernel","display":"df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel — ZFC Measure8 Stochastic Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel — ZFC Measure8 Stochastic Kernel","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel — ZFC Measure8 Stochastic Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B \\in V\">\\(K,X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K[x]\">\\(K[x]\\)</span> is the section function defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S\\)</span> is the five-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}section}\\vdash K[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle B,r\\rangle:\\langle\\langle x,B\\rangle,r\\rangle\\in K\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}section}\\vdash K[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle B,r\\rangle:\\langle\\langle x,B\\rangle,r\\rangle\\in K\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land K\\in[0,1]^{X\\times\\mathcal B}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(K[x],Y,\\mathcal B)\\land K[x](Y)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)&lt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land K\\in[0,1]^{X\\times\\mathcal B}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(K[x],Y,\\mathcal B)\\land K[x](Y)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)&lt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一族条件使每个截面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_x\">\\(K_x\\)</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 上的概率测度；第二族条件使每个评价映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto K(x,B)\">\\(x\\mapsto K(x,B)\\)</span> 可测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K[x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}section}\\vdash K[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle B,r\\rangle:\\langle\\langle x,B\\rangle,r\\rangle\\in K\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StochasticKernel}_S(K,X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land K\\in[0,1]^{X\\times\\mathcal B}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(K[x],Y,\\mathcal B)\\land K[x](Y)=1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(\\{x\\in X:K(\\langle x,B\\rangle)<r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"K_x","display":false},{"tex":"(Y,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto K(x,B)","display":false}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2661","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel.md|58-df-zfc-measure8-stochastic-kernel]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a740bdad87b97ac6","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}